@mVasu.Api_HostAddress = https://localhost:7216

### Health check (anonyymi)
GET {{mVasu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

###

### OpenAPI document (development only)
GET {{mVasu.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

###

# /api/me — vaatii bearer-tokenin Entra ID -tenantilta.
# Tokenin hankinta devissae:
#  1) Avaa PWA https://localhost:4200, kirjaudu (vaiheesta 9 alkaen)
#  2) Tai Azure CLI: az account get-access-token --resource api://d2f69daf-210b-4f64-b402-7914c4c9d0b4
#  3) Liitae token tähaen: @bearerToken = <eyJ...>

@bearerToken =

### Get authenticated user profile
GET {{mVasu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

###

### Update user settings
PUT {{mVasu.Api_HostAddress}}/api/me/settings
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

{
    "preferredName": "Mikko",
    "theme": "dark",
    "language": "fi"
}

###
